        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "AABCAA",
      "rhyme_vowel": "AABCAA"
    },
    {
      "section_id": "section_1",
      "type": "verse",
      "performer": "",
      "lines": [
        {
          "n": "0",
          "text": "All y'all niggas smoking y'all brains out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "In the car called life, took the lame route",
          "rhyme": "ut",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "Going nowhere fast, but you think that you not",
          "rhyme": "Ot",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
          "text": "'Cause you never hesitate to take the thang out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "4",
          "text": "In the drop top, pop the trunk then pop-pop",
          "rhyme": "Op",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "5",
          "text": "At his drop top, took another lame out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "6",
          "text": "Oh, you the big nigga? Take a hit, nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "7",
          "text": "Well, I hope you understand you ain't shit, nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "8",
          "text": "'Cause them niggas whole purpose is to get niggas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "9",
          "text": "And make sure that your mama cry the pain out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "10",
          "text": "Now that gang's out to get you, but you stuck in the same house",
          "rhyme": "awz",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "11",
          "text": "Nigga never came out, wow",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "12",
          "text": "It's a shame how you got sucked in that life",
          "rhyme": "ajf",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "13",
          "text": "But hey, man, at least you got a name now",
          "rhyme": "o",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "14",
          "text": "They say you a \"real nigga\" 'cause you kill niggas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "15",
          "text": "Nuts for that ice and that cream banana peel niggas",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "16",
          "text": "Banana clips spill, niggas wanna bang out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "17",
          "text": "For approval, boy, you can't even hang out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "18",
          "text": "That light you hit, it was the light I held",
          "rhyme": "Eld",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "19",
          "text": "That's why you never ever see me with my chain out",
          "rhyme": "awt",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "20",
          "text": "I don't need to, truth they don't feed you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "21",
          "text": "Lies what they got on their plate, they gon' eat you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "22",
          "text": "They got a homie called Karma, he gon' meet you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "23",
          "text": "Better look the other way if he ever see you",
          "rhyme": "u",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        },
        {
          "n": "24",
          "text": "And run as fast as you can, nigga",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_chur_bum"
        }
      ],
      "rhyme": "ABCADAEEEAFGHGEEAAIAJJJJE",
      "rhyme_vowel": "ABCACAAAAAADADAAAAEABBBBA"
    },
    {
