          "text": "I'm runnin', I'm runnin', I'm runnin'",
          "rhyme": ")",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "1",
          "text": "That's the shit I be talkin' 'bout, though (I'm runnin', I'm runnin')",
          "rhyme": "O",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "2",
          "text": "We ain't tryna hear that shit, my nigga (I'm runnin')",
          "rhyme": "a",
          "persona_id": "persona_guest"
        },
        {
          "n": "3",
